{"id":"rela_mpago","lemma":"relâmpago","pos":"adj","rank":4376,"glosses":["sudden and unexpected"],"ipa":"/ʁɨˈlɐ̃.pɐ.ɡu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-rel%C3%A2mpago.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu fui atingido por um relâmpago.","en":"I got hit by lightning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535097","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to strike, to touch","l":"atingir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Um relâmpago atingiu a torre.","en":"Lightning struck the tower.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to strike, to touch","l":"atingir"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"tower"}]},{"text":"O relâmpago precede o trovão.","en":"Lightning precedes thunder.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to precede","l":"preceder"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"thunder"}]},{"text":"O relâmpago é geralmente seguido por um trovão.","en":"Lightning is usually followed by thunder.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"generally, usually"},{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"thunder"}]}]}